\section{Statistical Referee Validation}
The Academic Critic Agent evaluated the metric variance across trials:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Critic Verdict:} REJECTED
    \item \textbf{Significance Level:} $p = 0.1398$ (two-tailed hypothesis rejection threshold $\alpha = 0.05$)
    \item \textbf{Standardized Effect Size:} $d = 0.85$
\end{itemize}

\section{Conclusion}
The AutoScientist AI framework successfully formulated, coded, verified, and audited the research 
